    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "CONTINENTAL\nAIRLINES\nNEW DC-7B CONTINENTAL CLUB COACH, BETWEEN CHICAGO AND LOS ANGELES",
      "The Douglas DC-7B, America's finest, fastest\nairliner, flies Continental's routes between\nChicago,\n• Kansas City, Denver\nand Los\nAngeles. It has a cruising speed of 365 m.p.h.\nand is equipped with Weather Avoidance\nRadar. The cabin has the finest luxury ap-\npointments including a spacious five seat Clut\nLounge, also a unique Stag Smoker Lounge.\nHi There:\nJust a reminder that we have\nnot received your report for\nIn the\nevent it is now in the mail,\nplease disregard.\nThanks\nfor your business.\nlack\nBrown\nistrict Agency Sales\nContinental Airlines\nBE THERE instead of en Route\nGENUIN\nMgr.\nEICH-CHICAGO '•C.T. ART-COLORTONE'\nPOST CARD\n(REG.U.S.PAT.OFF:)\nVia Air Mail\n4¢\nPOSTAGE\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\n7C-H17\n2015.166.0556"
    ],
